## Third-party data

This repository's `artifacts/latents/` directory contains 1024-dimensional
DiFuMo projections derived from frames of the UCF-Crime dataset
(https://www.crcv.ucf.edu/projects/real-world). The original UCF-Crime
dataset is released for non-commercial research use only. Latents in this
repo are derivatives shipped to enable reproducibility of the published
results; downstream commercial use of the underlying surveillance video
data is not granted by this MIT license.

## Third-party models

The pipeline uses `facebook/tribev2` from
https://github.com/facebookresearch/TRIBEv2, distributed under its own
license (see TRIBEv2 repository). NISP code in this repo does not
redistribute TRIBE v2 weights; they are downloaded at runtime from the
HuggingFace Hub.
